## Interface: 11200
## Title: OctoWoW Client Mods
## Notes: OctoChallenges paperdoll icons. The character-select features (reordering, row icons, server status) come from patch-9.mpq - see the GitHub release.
## Author: Krool
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: OctoChallengesDB
# This toc exists so adding the repo's git URL to OctoLauncher as an addon
# works: the launcher clones to Interface\AddOns\octowow-client-mods and the
# client requires <folder>\<folder>.toc. It loads the in-game addon from its
# subfolder; the glue half (patch-9.mpq) cannot be installed this way - the
# notice file points those users at the release installer. If you also have
# the standalone OctoChallenges addon, remove one - a load guard prevents
# harm, but the duplicate SavedVariables copy of whichever loads second wins.
Addons\OctoChallenges\OctoChallenges.lua
LauncherNotice.lua
